edTestSetTitle,\r\n              testTitle: \'Update Firmware\',\r\n              testId: 7,\r\n              testerName: window.selectedProduct.testerName,\r\n              testPassed: 0,\r\n              serverFriendlyName: window.selectedProduct.serverFriendlyName,\r\n              macAddress: macAdress,\r\n              extAnalyticsProductionId: window.selectedProduct.calibrationClients[index].analyticsProductionId,\r\n              failMsg: error,\r\n              customError: \'\'\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        },\r\n        { headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" }}\r\n      );\r\n    \r\n      if (response.data.message) {\r\n        promptUser(response.data.message);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      reject(error);\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n}', 1),
